# Infinite Weblinks — environment configuration
#
# Booking / contact form submission endpoint (the ONE value needed for
# production). Set this to a configured external form endpoint, e.g. a
# Formspree form URL (https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxx). When it is unset, the
# booking form uses a dev-safe mock that simulates success without sending
# anything anywhere. No credentials are stored in the repo.
#
# PUBLIC_ prefix is required so the value is available to the client island.
PUBLIC_BOOKING_ENDPOINT=
